OL,3,GNEWSASchool could reopen as specialist
OL,4,Aeducation centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former village school could reopen as
OL,7,Fa specialist education provision under
OL,8,Fnew proposals by Warwickshire County
OL,9,FCouncil.
OL,11,FGreat Alne Primary School in Alcester
OL,12,Fwas closed down in July after pupil
OL,13,Fnumbers had fallen since 2023 to just
OL,14,F12 children.
OL,16,FUnder council plans, the school would
OL,17,Fprovide up to 40 specialist places for
OL,18,Fprimary-aged children with autism,
OL,19,Fspeech, language and communication
OL,20,Fneeds.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
