OL,3,GNEWSASchool could reopen as specialist
OL,4,Aeducation centre
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I know the closure of the primary
OL,7,Fschool was difficult for the local
OL,8,Fcommunity, but this proposal offers a
OL,9,Fchance to keep that educational
OL,10,Fconnection in the village," councillor
OL,11,FWayne Briggs said.
